00:02:28.485 --> 00:02:31.291
- Yeah, and for those of you who are like,

00:02:31.291 --> 00:02:33.342
"Okay well, I can't go
to your damn workshop

00:02:33.342 --> 00:02:37.436
"so I kind of (breaks up)
that," it starts with awareness.

00:02:37.436 --> 00:02:41.127
You can't intervene in
a world you can't see.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:43.217
We cannot change what we cannot see,

00:02:43.217 --> 00:02:47.942
and a lot of people are
working on what they can see.

00:02:47.942 --> 00:02:50.050
And so for us, step number one,

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.092
and this goes into the success habits,

00:02:52.092 --> 00:02:54.141
is starting with awareness,

00:02:54.141 --> 00:02:57.003
because awareness proceeds choice,

00:02:57.003 --> 00:02:58.670
so one would have to

00:03:01.025 --> 00:03:04.852
really take a deep dive into the places

00:03:04.852 --> 00:03:07.830
where they try to avoid the most.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.772
- Yeah, and what's
interesting is when you're in

00:03:11.772 --> 00:03:14.149
experiential work, what happens is

00:03:14.149 --> 00:03:17.359
we put you in chaotic
situations where you have

00:03:17.359 --> 00:03:22.070
no mental ability to try
and control how you show up,

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:25.370
and it's how you actually
show up in the world,

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.836
