00:03:30.638 --> 00:03:34.531
"Okay, how do I want to choose
to show up when I'm in chaos,

00:03:34.531 --> 00:03:36.563
"or when I'm in stress,
when I'm in overwhelm,"

00:03:36.563 --> 00:03:38.538
