00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.012
and you're getting real-time feedback,

00:03:52.012 --> 00:03:54.040
especially for people
in your life on that,

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:58.028
then you can choose
powerfully to move forward.

00:03:58.028 --> 00:03:59.049
