00:04:07.752 --> 00:04:11.102
I know it's a general question,
but in general, (laughs),

00:04:11.102 --> 00:04:13.511
what do you feel like is
some of the biggest, yeah.

00:04:13.511 --> 00:04:15.994
- It's everywhere, a lot of
people have the intention

00:04:15.994 --> 00:04:17.911
