00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.043
But yet, the feedback that
people are giving them

00:04:25.043 --> 00:04:26.751
in our workshops, and
that we're giving them,

00:04:26.751 --> 00:04:29.209
is that they're closed off,

00:04:29.209 --> 00:04:31.855
they come across as fake or inauthentic,

00:04:31.855 --> 00:04:35.269
and when you're showing up that
way, people don't trust you.

00:04:35.269 --> 00:04:37.775
They're kind of like, I feel
like there's a disconnect.

00:04:37.775 --> 00:04:40.076
I feel like something's between us,

00:04:40.076 --> 00:04:42.611
and I'm not going to say
yes to your business,

00:04:42.611 --> 00:04:44.637
I'm not going to say yes
to your online program,

00:04:44.637 --> 00:04:45.894
because there's something about you

00:04:45.894 --> 00:04:48.727
that I can't put my finger
on that I don't buy yet.

00:04:48.727 --> 00:04:51.695
- Yes, and what that comes down to

00:04:51.695 --> 00:04:54.635
is trying to get it right.

00:04:54.635 --> 00:04:56.948
So many of us are trying to get it right,

00:04:56.948 --> 00:04:59.621
because we've been brought up in a society

00:04:59.621 --> 00:05:03.026
that has told us over,
and over, and over again,

00:05:03.026 --> 00:05:05.299
to do one thing to get another thing.

00:05:05.299 --> 00:05:08.270
And so, a lot of people unconsciously,

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.792
this is not a conscious mind thing,

00:05:09.792 --> 00:05:13.679
the unconscious mind is
operating trying to get it right,

00:05:13.679 --> 00:05:16.061
and so, there's this
mask that's showing up

00:05:16.061 --> 00:05:19.344
in front of them, and
that mask is disingenuine,

00:05:19.344 --> 00:05:21.314
and people can read through.

00:05:21.314 --> 00:05:24.294
The bullshit meter now,
especially with so much stuff

00:05:24.294 --> 00:05:26.354
that's on the internet, is like, (snaps).

00:05:26.354 --> 00:05:29.771
- It's so high. (laughs)

00:05:33.631 --> 00:05:34.667
- I'm an entrepreneur,

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:38.737
and I want to be a visionary,
and be a team leader,

00:05:38.737 --> 00:05:41.955
and inspire my people, and
when things are going good,

00:05:41.955 --> 00:05:43.163
maybe that's what I do;

00:05:43.163 --> 00:05:45.463
but then when something happens,

00:05:45.463 --> 00:05:47.963
kind of urgent crisis, now you turn into

00:05:47.963 --> 00:05:50.634
this rage-aholic person
who you don't want to be,

00:05:50.634 --> 00:05:53.766
but that is who you are when
things are not going right.

00:05:53.766 --> 00:05:55.102
Like, that sounds like you're forcing them

00:05:55.102 --> 00:05:57.421
into these stressful, painful situations,

00:05:57.421 --> 00:05:58.553
like how do you act?

00:05:58.553 --> 00:06:01.040
Okay great, so that's how I act,

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.763
I don't want to be that
person, now what do I do?

00:06:04.763 --> 00:06:06.860
You've opened up this giant wound,

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.338
now how are you going to fix me?

00:06:09.338 --> 00:06:12.954
- Yeah, so this brings us
to step number two which is

00:06:12.954 --> 00:06:15.180
being radically responsible.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.698
And again, you need the
awareness first, to say,

00:06:17.698 --> 00:06:21.269
"Oh, I'm showing up like a
raging lunatic in chaos,"

00:06:21.269 --> 00:06:24.482
in you're example, and with
step number two it's going,

00:06:24.482 --> 00:06:26.535
"Okay, how am I
fully-responsible for this?"

00:06:26.535 --> 00:06:30.813
If I was taking 100%
responsibility of the entire pie,

00:06:30.813 --> 00:06:31.928
how did I create this?

00:06:31.928 --> 00:06:32.812
How did I allow this?

00:06:32.812 --> 00:06:35.247
How did I perpetuate this situation?

00:06:35.247 --> 00:06:39.375
And how am I choosing to
be the space for chaos?

00:06:39.375 --> 00:06:41.157
Because in our work, in The Bridge,

00:06:41.157 --> 00:06:43.958
we say that you are the bridge
to all areas of your life,

00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:46.502
meaning chaos cannot enter your being,

00:06:46.502 --> 00:06:48.345
unless you build a bridge for it.

00:06:48.345 --> 00:06:51.741
And that's where radical
responsibility comes in,

00:06:51.741 --> 00:06:54.154
because we see a lot of leaders,

00:06:54.154 --> 00:06:56.534
especially leaders that
we coach and work with,

00:06:56.534 --> 00:07:01.139
that when shit hits the fan
and everything goes awry,

00:07:01.139 --> 00:07:02.322
what happens is they go,

00:07:02.322 --> 00:07:06.299
"Oh well, this person
in my management team

00:07:06.299 --> 00:07:10.748
isn't doing this," or "the
economic climate is doing this,"

00:07:10.748 --> 00:07:12.779
and it's always outside of themselves.

00:07:12.779 --> 00:07:14.484
So, we always bring it back to them,

00:07:14.484 --> 00:07:17.076
because when you're taking
a 100% responsibility,

00:07:17.076 --> 00:07:21.375
as you know, you have 100% of
the power to make a change.

00:07:21.375 --> 00:07:23.693
So, that's really the next thing to do.

00:07:23.693 --> 00:07:26.312
- And what did you call it, radical?

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:30.315
- Radical responsibility.
- Radical responsibility.

00:07:30.315 --> 00:07:32.089
So then, the people who
come in and will say,

00:07:32.089 --> 00:07:35.589
"But you know, the economy, the president,

00:07:36.939 --> 00:07:39.606
"my resources," whatever excuse,

00:07:40.573 --> 00:07:41.934
how do you break through
that and say like,

00:07:41.934 --> 00:07:44.951
"Guys, you know it's all on you."

00:07:44.951 --> 00:07:45.784
How do you make them feel it?

00:07:45.784 --> 00:07:47.336
'Cause they may think it,
but how do you get them

00:07:47.336 --> 00:07:49.192
to actually understand that?

00:07:49.192 --> 00:07:52.739
- Yes so, here's one of
the things to understand:

00:07:52.739 --> 00:07:57.090
we are linguistic beings, so
we build with our language.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:59.256
We create worlds with our
language, and so one of the things

00:07:59.256 --> 00:08:01.439
that we support people in understanding

00:08:01.439 --> 00:08:04.939
is the distinction between being a victim,

00:08:06.447 --> 00:08:09.197
and holding victim consciousness.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.347
And so some people, things do happen,

00:08:12.347 --> 00:08:15.017
we cannot control what
is happening, right?

00:08:15.017 --> 00:08:18.577
There are certain
realities that are, right?

00:08:18.577 --> 00:08:20.675
And the moment we start
arguing with reality,

00:08:20.675 --> 00:08:22.459
we move into victim consciousness,

00:08:22.459 --> 00:08:25.955
we move into this, "I'm at
the effect of the world,"

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.419
and, "Oh woe is me," right?

00:08:28.419 --> 00:08:29.905
And a lot of times it doesn't look

00:08:29.905 --> 00:08:32.380
like victim consciousness,
but that's exactly what it is.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.084
Whenever you're blaming, or complaining,

00:08:34.084 --> 00:08:38.594
and we say all the time, "Your
complaint is your mission."

00:08:38.594 --> 00:08:39.427
If you're complaining,

00:08:39.427 --> 00:08:42.886
that means that you have some part of you

00:08:42.886 --> 00:08:45.751
that believes there is a better solution

00:08:45.751 --> 00:08:47.371
for how this gets to be worked out.

00:08:47.371 --> 00:08:50.129
And so, you can be a stand for something,

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:54.800
and hold the space of
love all at the same time.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.876
- You guys are takin' us on a trip today,

00:08:56.876 --> 00:08:58.244
this is not what I expected,

00:08:58.244 --> 00:09:01.440
but I'm enjoyin' it, man, this is good!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.333
We're getitn' some live questions:

00:09:04.333 --> 00:09:06.748
what do I do if I'm only 16?

00:09:06.748 --> 00:09:08.197
Do you deal with younger people?

00:09:08.197 --> 00:09:09.594
I guess there's less baggage,

00:09:09.594 --> 00:09:10.932
but there may be less confidence,

00:09:10.932 --> 00:09:12.795
how does this change
depending on how old you are,

00:09:12.795 --> 00:09:15.356
or where you are in life?

00:09:15.356 --> 00:09:17.156
- The next step, this brings
us straight to number three,

00:09:17.156 --> 00:09:19.581
the next step is act now.

00:09:19.581 --> 00:09:21.156
That means clearing your past,

00:09:21.156 --> 00:09:23.648
and really getting
responsible with your past,

00:09:23.648 --> 00:09:26.188
so that you can create,
clear, and then present,

00:09:26.188 --> 00:09:29.647
and move forward powerfully in the future.

00:09:29.647 --> 00:09:31.040
For anyone that's young,

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.548
you guys have an extreme advantage,

00:09:33.548 --> 00:09:35.556
because you have less baggage;

00:09:35.556 --> 00:09:38.117
you have less crap that
you need to move through;

00:09:38.117 --> 00:09:40.102
you have less conditioning,
less programming,

00:09:40.102 --> 00:09:42.840
less mapping of the world on your psyche;

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.671
so you're showing up with a cleaner slate.

00:09:45.671 --> 00:09:49.435
And at 16 if you're
watching shows like this,

00:09:49.435 --> 00:09:52.096
you are like killin' it already! (laughs)

00:09:52.096 --> 00:09:53.053
- Yeah, for sure.

00:09:53.053 --> 00:09:54.280
- And it's really cool, Evan,

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.887
because I don't know
if you've noticed this,

00:09:56.887 --> 00:09:58.548
but we've noticed in our work

00:09:58.548 --> 00:10:00.604
that our audience is getting younger.

00:10:00.604 --> 00:10:01.858
I mean, we're getting 16 year olds,

00:10:01.858 --> 00:10:03.214
we're getting 13 year olds,

00:10:03.214 --> 00:10:06.842
we're getting 12 year olds
who are watching our stuff.

00:10:06.842 --> 00:10:08.675
It's really powerful to see

00:10:08.675 --> 00:10:11.745
the generational shift that's happening,

00:10:11.745 --> 00:10:14.976
where young people are waking
up at a lot younger of an age,

00:10:14.976 --> 00:10:18.507
and they're saying, "I'm not
buying into the system anymore,

00:10:18.507 --> 00:10:20.130
"the system doesn't work."

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:23.723
The old paradigm of go to
school, get a good degree,

00:10:23.723 --> 00:10:26.963
get a good job, get married,
have 2.5 kids, it doesn't work,

00:10:26.963 --> 00:10:29.333
it's not secure anymore.

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:30.878
The world of the entrepreneur

00:10:30.878 --> 00:10:32.715
is really picking up right now.

00:10:32.715 --> 00:10:34.627
- Yes, and that never was secure,

00:10:34.627 --> 00:10:38.212
and that's the thing that this illusion,

00:10:38.212 --> 00:10:40.889
this Western contingency plan

00:10:40.889 --> 00:10:43.621
where we do all of this stuff over there,

00:10:43.621 --> 00:10:46.121
to get some future "goodness",

00:10:47.142 --> 00:10:49.899
none of that stuff actually
was true in the first place.

00:10:49.899 --> 00:10:51.816
So if you're 16, or 60,

00:10:53.941 --> 00:10:56.545
