there, and that's the issue.

00:11:04.197 --> 00:11:06.275
So many of us are trying
to get high on good,

00:11:06.275 --> 00:11:07.447
and we're trying to get there.

00:11:07.447 --> 00:11:09.691
We go, (inhales), "One more
hit, I got to get there,

00:11:09.691 --> 00:11:10.658
"I got to get good!"
- I got to get

00:11:10.658 --> 00:11:12.871
my first million, then
I got to get 10 million,

00:11:12.871 --> 00:11:14.861
then I got to do this
and get a private jet.

00:11:14.861 --> 00:11:17.024
- Which is slavery.
- It is.

00:11:17.024 --> 00:11:19.335
- Man, you're still a slave to
the jet and everything else.

00:11:19.335 --> 00:11:21.747
It's not the mountain that
we conquer, but the self.

00:11:21.747 --> 00:11:25.257
And so, it's about who
you become on the way,

00:11:25.257 --> 00:11:28.291
it's about where you go
in your own consciousness,

00:11:28.291 --> 00:11:32.639
where you have to go within
yourself along that journey.

00:11:32.639 --> 00:11:36.730
You know, we get so caught
up on the destination,

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:39.255
we want the product,
but we miss the process.

00:11:39.255 --> 00:11:42.127
And so, it's about falling
in love with the process.

00:11:42.127 --> 00:11:44.461
- And falling in love
with the game of life.

00:11:44.461 --> 00:11:46.692
You mention the reasons and the excuses,

