and can take it out here,

00:36:04.552 --> 00:36:07.052
and has me outside of the box.

00:36:08.010 --> 00:36:10.307
It's really cool, because
that complements each other,

00:36:10.307 --> 00:36:13.802
and our weaknesses, where
I'm weak, he's strong;

00:36:13.802 --> 00:36:15.381
where's he's weak, I'm strong;

00:36:15.381 --> 00:36:17.271
and where we're weak,

00:36:17.271 --> 00:36:19.874
we're working on developing
and bringing those up.

00:36:19.874 --> 00:36:22.847
So it really is, like he
