00:36:24.368 --> 00:36:26.014
But at the end of the day,

00:36:26.014 --> 00:36:28.806
our leadership is about
empowering others to rise,

00:36:28.806 --> 00:36:31.088
and if he's wizened in a moment,

00:36:31.088 --> 00:36:32.841
and he's disturbed in that moment,

